    - The fixtures cover: default and custom test.globs, empty test.globs, the `**/` and `/**` candidates, BOM and CRLF, CR-only lines, comments, whitespace, form feed and NBSP, fnmatch brackets and case, non-ASCII paths, a dot-prefix sibling hit, symlinked globs and manifests, no manifests dir, an empty manifest.
