    Ruling: compatible fail-closed hardening, recorded as an OBSERVATION and not a FAIL. From a directory that cannot be listed, "no entry matches <task>.*.files" cannot be established, and the Rule's "failing to read for any other reason" covers that. Base parse() threw EACCES/ENOTDIR in two of these cases.

